WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:09.160
Welcome to Edgewood volunteering! This is part one of five: signing up. Your paperwork comes next, one short video at a time.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:14.107
Step one. On the Hub's volunteer page, tap Sign in with Google.

00:00:14.307 --> 00:00:18.500
Or, type your email in the box below. Either one works.

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:24.420
Step two. The Hub doesn't know your email yet, so tap, I'm new: sign me up.

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:31.052
Step three. Fill in your name. If you're turning in paperwork for a student, enter the student's name.

00:00:31.252 --> 00:00:35.349
Your email is already filled in, and locked, so it can't get mistyped.

00:00:35.549 --> 00:00:39.112
Is the volunteer under eighteen? We'll cover Yes in a moment.

00:00:39.312 --> 00:00:40.571
Add a phone number,

00:00:40.771 --> 00:00:42.137
and your shirt size.

00:00:42.337 --> 00:00:45.282
Check every group your students are in, not just one.

00:00:45.482 --> 00:00:51.051
Then list every student your hours count for, by first and last name, separated by commas.

00:00:51.251 --> 00:01:07.430
Want to manage your family's volunteer credit? Check, I'd like to be the family manager. When credit is paid out, the family manager decides how it's split between your students. The IU liaison approves it, and nothing changes until then.

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:14.062
Step four. If the volunteer is under eighteen, tap Yes, and add a parent and a parent phone.

00:01:14.262 --> 00:01:18.710
Your paperwork list adds a minor release, for a parent to sign.

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:26.110
Step five. Below your info is your paperwork list. Each document has its own short video in this series.

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:31.270
Already have signed paper copies? Add them in each card, and tap Submit.

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:42.560
Step six. Open the Levy volunteer packet card, and tap Save my info and sign online. It saves your info, and opens Levy's packet to sign.

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:48.147
Step seven. Check that everything is right, including the family manager line.

00:01:48.347 --> 00:01:52.410
Then tap Yes, save it. Levy's packet opens next.

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:56.770
Up next, part two: signing the Levy packet.
